id=stryker_s21_backend
name=Stryker S21 Nexmon Backend
version=v1.1.0
versionCode=2
author=noamtu123
description=Native aircrack-ng + wireless_tools backend and launcher for the Stryker S21 fork (Exynos 2100, Floppy kernel Nexmon). Supplies native wireless tools in system/bin, installs/updates the fork app, and launches it from the Action button. Does NOT change SELinux or remount firmware (bcm_mon_boot keeps doing that).
